Package: svfilters.hg19
Title: Filters for structural variant analyses
Version: 0.0.27
Authors@R: c(
    person("Rob", "Scharpf", email = "rscharpf@jhu.edu", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Nick", "Vulpescu", role = "ctb"))
Description: Provides GRanges objects as filters for structural variant analyses,
    and a transcripts object annotated with cancer genes. Annotation derived from
    OncoKB (<https://www.oncokb.org>) is redistributed with the permission of
    Memorial Sloan Kettering Cancer Center under the OncoKB Terms of Use
    (<https://www.oncokb.org/terms>); see LICENSE.note.
Depends:
    R (>= 3.2.0), GenomicRanges (>= 1.31.16)
Imports:
    BiocGenerics, GenomeInfoDb
Suggests: testthat
License: Artistic-2.0
LazyData: true
RoxygenNote: 6.0.1
